## Controls
- **None:** it reads the rooms and the route that the stages before it made [[own]].

## Measured traits
@@measured

- **Rooms, hot rooms:** with 50 attempts, {{c21.rooms.median}} rooms at the median. Its route: {{c21.path.median}} steps, vs the caves’ {{c18.path.median}} [[run:c21.rooms.median c21.path.median c18.path.median]].
  - **Why longer:** corridors join the rooms in left-to-right order, not by the shortest way [[own]].

